op and in the browser (ReadBufferAsync, sharing the texture readback's browser map helper). A compute pass follows the render pass rules: one pass of either kind open, submit, readback and present refuse while one is. Dispatches over MaxComputeWorkgroupsPerDimension and calls on disposed pipelines, bind groups or buffers throw instead of silently yielding zeros or aborting inside wgpu-native; IComputeEncoder documents that WriteBuffer is ordered against submits, not dispatches. DeviceLimits reports the storage and compute limits. Also fixes an existing abort: disposing a render pipeline with no bindings released a null pipeline layout. Tests that would abort the process before their fix run in a child process of the test executable (NativeAbortProbe).","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"pnpm/pnpm","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-27T06:36:22Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"9f9472ff59a93fa84f00780d0dc1be92331b40a8","github_link":"https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/commit/9f9472ff59a93fa84f00780d0dc1be92331b40a8","commit_subject":"fix: reuse fresh metadata mirrors that have no etag (#15879)","ai_tool":"Claude,Cursor"},{"repo_name":"StoDevX/AAO-React-Native","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-27T06:36:16Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"23f619438ad71e03dd30c2fd40658f3d5a616e3c","github_link":"https://github.com/StoDevX/AAO-React-Native/commit/23f619438ad71e03dd30c2fd40658f3d5a616e3c","commit_subject":"Merge pull request #8226 from StoDevX/claude/map-card-fields","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"nebulastream/nautilus","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-27T06:36:04Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"42668b69122e7f6671731a7d8ffe6c87c2c27fea","github_link":"https://github.com/nebulastream/nautilus/commit/42668b69122e7f6671731a7d8ffe6c87c2c27fea","commit_subject":"Check the regions demo against the seam-free IR","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"SubtitleEdit/subtitleedit","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-27T06:35:45Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"04056ab2ba7ff6c53c94992f199c8a1c2932f56e","github_link":"h